# 5-second demo for the README — renders docs/assets/demo.gif.
# Regenerate: stage a demo store as CLAUDE_HOME, put `chf` on PATH, run
#   vhs docs/assets/demo.tape
Output docs/assets/demo.gif
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 920
Set Height 360
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Type "chf -o clipboard"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2800ms
